    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please hold for the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769541414000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. You're speaking with Diana at VeloFit. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769541422266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 97946,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769541428266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. To get started, could I have your name and order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769541430266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Mark Peterson. Order is 85-21-994.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 97946,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769541437399999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Mark. Let me just pull that up... Okay, I see your order for the VeloFit Pro-Form cycling shoes. What specifically is the issue with them?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769541439866665
    },
    {
      "text": "They're just not right.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 97946,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769541449999998
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. To clarify, is it a technical fault with the shoe or more of a sizing and preference issue?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769541451733331
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know. I put my cleats on them, rode for an hour, and now I have massive blisters. So I want to return them.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 97946,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769541458933331
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm very sorry to hear about that. Getting blisters is definitely not the experience we want for our customers. Just to confirm, you are looking for a full refund, correct?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769541466799997
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. A refund.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 97946,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769541478466663
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, not a problem at all. I can see here that your delivery date was 27 days ago, which is unfortunately outside our 10-day return policy for standard items like these cycling shoes. I've gone ahead and approved that return for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769541479599996
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 97946,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769541494733329
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just sent a prepaid return label to the email address on file. You can print that out, attach it to the original box, and drop it off at any post office. Once our warehouse receives the item, your refund will be processed within 3-5 business days.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769541495433329
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. I guess that's it then.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 97946,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769541512433329
    },
    {
